    "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "is there any easy way to use `mini.pick` for `vim.ui.input` and `vim.ui.select`? similar to `stevearc/dressing.nvim`\r\nActually I want to use it for `code_action` list.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">is there any easy way to use <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.pick</code> for <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.ui.input</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.ui.select</code>? similar to <code class=\"notranslate\">stevearc/dressing.nvim</code><br>\nActually I want to use it for <code class=\"notranslate\">code_action</code> list.</p>",
    "bodyText": "is there any easy way to use mini.pick for vim.ui.input and vim.ui.select? similar to stevearc/dressing.nvim\nActually I want to use it for code_action list.",
