            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "`vim.ui.select` - [yes](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e578f353d0b1d9f21a9640458d8e506c0c9acf5e/doc/mini-pick.txt#L27).\r\n`vim.ui.input` - no, as this doesn't involve picking from an array.\r\n\r\nPlease, read help page.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">vim.ui.select</code> - <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e578f353d0b1d9f21a9640458d8e506c0c9acf5e/doc/mini-pick.txt#L27\">yes</a>.<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">vim.ui.input</code> - no, as this doesn't involve picking from an array.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Please, read help page.</p>",
